1
00:00:00,288 --> 00:00:01,491
Seekor semut berteriak

2
00:00:01,511 --> 00:00:02,981
memperingatkan kawanannya.

3
00:00:03,001 --> 00:00:04,266
Dan seorang nabi mendengarnya,

4
00:00:04,286 --> 00:00:05,080
lalu tersenyum.

5
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,324
Nabi Sulaiman mewarisi Dawud.

6
00:00:07,344 --> 00:00:08,795
Surah An-Naml menyebut ia

7
00:00:08,815 --> 00:00:09,959
diajari bahasa burung.

8
00:00:09,979 --> 00:00:11,770
Bala tentaranya dari jin,

9
00:00:11,790 --> 00:00:13,442
manusia, dan burung berbaris

10
00:00:13,462 --> 00:00:14,174
dengan tertib.

11
00:00:14,194 --> 00:00:15,449
Saat mereka tiba di lembah

12
00:00:15,469 --> 00:00:17,124
semut, seekor semut berkata:

13
00:00:17,144 --> 00:00:18,307
wahai semut-semut,

14
00:00:18,327 --> 00:00:19,809
masuklah ke sarang kalian,

15
00:00:19,829 --> 00:00:21,109
agar tidak terinjak Sulaiman

16
00:00:21,129 --> 00:00:21,759
dan tentaranya,

17
00:00:21,779 --> 00:00:23,514
sedang mereka tidak menyadari.

18
00:00:23,534 --> 00:00:24,689
Sulaiman tersenyum,

19
00:00:24,709 --> 00:00:25,888
lalu berdoa:

20
00:00:25,908 --> 00:00:26,817
ya Tuhanku,

21
00:00:26,837 --> 00:00:28,489
ilhamkan aku untuk tetap

22
00:00:28,509 --> 00:00:29,665
mensyukuri nikmat-Mu.

23
00:00:29,685 --> 00:00:31,475
Kekuasaan sebesar itu,

24
00:00:31,495 --> 00:00:33,425
dan yang ia minta justru rasa

25
00:00:33,445 --> 00:00:34,089
syukur.

26
00:00:34,109 --> 00:00:35,374
Lalu ia memeriksa

27
00:00:35,394 --> 00:00:36,380
burung-burung.

28
00:00:36,400 --> 00:00:38,178
Hud-hud tidak ada.

29
00:00:38,198 --> 00:00:38,875
Tak lama,

30
00:00:38,895 --> 00:00:40,977
hud-hud datang membawa kabar

31
00:00:40,997 --> 00:00:42,100
dari negeri Saba:

32
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:43,816
seorang ratu memerintah,

33
00:00:43,836 --> 00:00:45,179
punya singgasana besar,

34
00:00:45,199 --> 00:00:46,433
dan kaumnya menyembah

35
00:00:46,453 --> 00:00:47,165
matahari.

36
00:00:47,185 --> 00:00:48,332
Sulaiman mengirim surat yang

37
00:00:48,352 --> 00:00:49,660
dibuka dengan bismillah.

38
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:51,440
Sang ratu bermusyawarah dengan

39
00:00:51,460 --> 00:00:52,517
para pembesarnya,

40
00:00:52,537 --> 00:00:54,036
lalu mengirim hadiah.

41
00:00:54,056 --> 00:00:55,333
Sulaiman menolak:

42
00:00:55,353 --> 00:00:56,231
apa yang Allah berikan

43
00:00:56,251 --> 00:00:57,490
kepadaku lebih baik.

44
00:00:57,510 --> 00:00:59,038
Sebelum ratu tiba,

45
00:00:59,058 --> 00:01:00,431
seorang yang berilmu dari

46
00:01:00,451 --> 00:01:01,561
Kitab memindahkan

47
00:01:01,581 --> 00:01:03,124
singgasananya, sebelum mata

48
00:01:03,144 --> 00:01:04,081
sempat berkedip.

49
00:01:04,101 --> 00:01:06,001
Lalu sang ratu masuk istana

50
00:01:06,021 --> 00:01:07,471
dan mengira lantainya kolam

51
00:01:07,491 --> 00:01:08,199
air.

52
00:01:08,219 --> 00:01:10,109
Ternyata, lantai yang dilapisi

53
00:01:10,129 --> 00:01:10,655
kaca.

54
00:01:10,675 --> 00:01:12,280
Di akhir kisah,

55
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:13,689
sang ratu berserah diri kepada

56
00:01:13,709 --> 00:01:15,903
Allah, Tuhan seluruh alam.

57
00:01:15,923 --> 00:01:17,281
Kekuasaan sebesar itu dipakai

58
00:01:17,301 --> 00:01:18,313
untuk bersyukur.

59
00:01:18,333 --> 00:01:19,945
Kalau kamu diberi kelebihan,

60
00:01:19,965 --> 00:01:21,697
apa yang pertama kamu lakukan?

